# Local test certificates (generated on each machine)
*.cer
*.crt
*.pfx
*.p12
*.pvk
*.spc
# The nightly trust anchor is a distributed public key, not a local test artifact: users download
# it to verify the nightly channel, so it has to be in the repository.
!nightly-signing.cer
